## Scoping in a monorepo

Cursor applies rules by glob. For a monorepo with more than one stack, split this
into per-app files so the mobile app never receives web rules:

`.cursor/rules/web.mdc`

```yaml
---
description: Web app standards
globs: ["apps/web/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
```

…pointing at `standards/platform/web.md` + `standards/framework/vue.md`, and a
matching `native.mdc` for `apps/mobile/**`. Keep guardrails and `core/rules.md` in
this always-applied file.
